==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Tarountula|17}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Hook''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon|Magnemite|61}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon}} expansion.
